"w": "working", "s": 64.659, "e": 64.903, "p": 9}, {"w": "on,", "s": 64.972, "e": 65.263, "p": 9}, {"w": "and", "s": 65.437, "e": 65.611, "p": 9}, {"w": "start", "s": 65.68, "e": 65.924, "p": 9}, {"w": "applying", "s": 65.959, "e": 66.331, "p": 9}, {"w": "it", "s": 66.389, "e": 66.458, "p": 9}, {"w": "alongside", "s": 66.528, "e": 67.12, "p": 9}, {"w": "us.", "s": 67.155, "e": 67.619, "p": 9}], "paras": [{"s": 0.6, "e": 4.965, "text": "Every week, I'm working on something in my business that involves AI, SaaS, or GoHighLevel."}, {"s": 5.265, "e": 12.185, "text": "Sometimes I'm building a product. Sometimes I'm working on getting customers. Sometimes I'm figuring out how to automate something that's taking too much time."}, {"s": 12.485, "e": 20.055, "text": "And along the way, I'm finding tools, building skills, testing strategies, and figuring out how these pieces work together."}, {"s": 20.355, "e": 23.559, "text": "This community is where I'm opening that up and sharing it with you."}, {"s": 23.859, "e": 31.707, "text": "You'll get the training behind what I'm doing, the available skills and resources that go with it, and coaching to help you apply it to your own business."}, {"s": 32.007, "e": 40.32, "text": "Because watching somebody build something is helpful. Being able to understand the decisions, get the resources, and ask questions makes it easier to build your version."}, {"s": 40.62, "e": 47.725, "text": "We'll cover using GoHighLevel, building with AI, creating SaaS offers, getting clients, and putting systems in place as you grow."}, {"s": 48.025, "e": 56.431, "text": "And this keeps evolving. As I test new approaches and find tools worth using, I'll bring those into the community through exclusive drops and new training."}, {"s": 56.731, "e": 62.954, "text": "If you follow my content and want to go deeper into how I actually approach building an online business, this is where that happens."}, {"s": 63.254, "e": 67.619, "text": "Join us inside, share what you're working on, and start applying it alongside us."}]}